# Armic Rehab Exercises — Reference Poses (Arduino UNO Q)

Controller target: **Arduino UNO Q MCU** only. Do not retarget docs or code comments to non-Arduino boards.

## Joint convention (LOCKED)
- **90° all joints** = straight chain, upper arm vertical (shoulder), elbow extended, wrist aligned.
- **shoulder 90°** = upper arm straight up (+Z). **>90°** leans forward in sagittal plane. **0° / 180°** = upper arm horizontal (left / right).
- **elbow 90°** = straight. **180°** = 90° bend (forearm ⊥ upper arm). **Min 90°** — never below.
- **wrist 90°** = aligned with forearm.
- **Stable home**: `{base:90, shoulder:90, elbow:95, wrist:90}` — elbow 95 resists gravity hunt.

## Floor rule (NEVER violate)
- Grid/floor at **Z = 0**. Base pivot at **Z = 60 mm** (`FLOOR_OFFSET`).
- Before applying any exercise pose or lerp, tip Z from `fk_solve()` must be **≥ 15 mm**.
- **Never** lerp shoulder 180↔90 while elbow also moves — mid-pose chevron/V does not match photos and can dive toward floor.
- Elbow band **[90°, 180°]** only.

## Exercise 1 — Bicep Curl (BC)
| | Angles `{b, sh, el, wr}` | Visual |
|--|--|--|
| **Bottom** | `{90, 120, 170, 180}` | Tip DOWN |
| **Top** | `{90, 120, 170, 25}` | Tip UP (wrist only) |
| **Motion** | Shoulder **120°** + elbow **170°** locked. Wrist only 180→25. |

## Exercise 2 — Lateral Raise
Photos: `docs/refs/lateral-tip-down.png`, `docs/refs/lateral-tip-out.png`
| | Angles `{b, sh, el, wr}` | Visual |
|--|--|--|
| **Tip OUT** | `{90, 90, 180, 90}` | Tip horizontal out |
| **Tip DOWN** | `{90, 90, 180, 180}` | Tip DOWN |
| **Motion** | Shoulder **90°** + elbow **180°** locked. Wrist only 90↔180. Seq `0→1→0`. |
| **WRONG** | Invented mid-waypoints; shoulder lead; hang sh=180; poses not in the two photos. |

## Exercise 3 — Elbow Flexion
| | Angles `{b, sh, el, wr}` | Visual |
|--|--|--|
| **Extended** | `{90, 0, 95, 90}` | Upper arm horizontal LEFT (`sh 0`, not 180) |
| **Peak** | `{90, 0, 180, 180}` | Tip back toward base |
| **Motion** | Shoulder fixed **0°**. Elbow + wrist flex together. |
| **WRONG** | `shoulder 180` — folds toward floor. |

## Implementation rules
- Exercises: synced multi-waypoint S-curve, brief hold at peak, 3 reps → stable home.
- Serial: `exercise bicep|lateral|elbowflex`
- After changing poses, verify on hardware against user photos.
